    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">hi Vincent,</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks for all your good work on this program.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">I wanted to verify the parameters that are used to define\r\nnon-wear.  Within your code, I\r\ncan see that the parameters vary by device (code pasted below).<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt\">There are a\r\nfew published papers that state that the parameters for non-wear for a\r\nGENEActiv device processed in GGIR are as follows. “<span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;;color:black;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">A time window was classified as non-wear time if, for at least two out\r\nof the three axes, the standard deviation was less than 13 m<em><span style=\"border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">g</span></em><span> </span>and the value range was less than 50 m<em><span style=\"border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">g</span></em>.<span>”  </span></span>Taken\r\nfrom : da Silva IC, van Hees VT, Ramires VV, Knuth AG, Bielemann RM, Ekelund U,\r\nBrage S, Hallal PC. Physical activity levels in three Brazilian birth cohorts\r\nas assessed with raw triaxial wrist accelerometry. Int J Epidemiol. 2014\r\nDec;43(6):1959-68. doi: 10.1093/ije/dyu203. PubMed PMID: 25361583; PubMed\r\nCentral PMCID: PMC4276065.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">This seems to contradict what is stated in the code as the default.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">I\r\nam writing up the methods for data that used ActiGraphs so I want to be sure\r\nthat I correctly defined the parameters in the case where we did not change your\r\ndefaults.  I have written:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\">Nonwear time was identified when the standard deviation (SD) was\r\nless than 13 mg for 2 of the 3 axes <b>and</b>\r\nif value range of <b>each accelerometer\r\naxis</b> was less than <b>150</b> mg,\r\ncalculated for moving windows of 60 minutes with 15- minute increments.  </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Is this correct?<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Natalie</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">g.getmeta.R excerpt – <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><a href=\"https://github.com/cran/GGIR/blob/af333fe33917552744aebb5551475b309beaa96b/R/g.getmeta.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/cran/GGIR/blob/af333fe33917552744aebb5551475b309beaa96b/R/g.getmeta.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792491627205000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0hJ2AWdSW_SOKW99oI_Osb\">https://github.com/cran/GGIR/blob/af333fe33917552744aebb5551475b309beaa96b/R/g.getmeta.R</a><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><br></p><table style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-collapse:collapse;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px\"><tbody style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(150,152,150)\">#non-wear criteria are monitor specific</span></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-right-width:1px\"></td><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\">            <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">if</span> (<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">mon</span> <span style=\"box-siz